              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ewe Uhoraho, ni wewe Mana yanje; nzogushira hejuru, ntazire izina ryawe; kuko wakoze ibitangaza, ivyo wagabiye uhereye kera, ur’ uwo kwizigirwa n’uw’ ukuri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 25:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.17.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 17:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.51.37"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 51:37",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuko wahinduye igisagara ibirundo vy’ amasakamburira, igisagara cubakiwe inzitiro wakigize amatongo, ingoro z’abanyamahanga watumye zitakiba igisagara, ntikizokwongera kwubakwa kugeza ibihe vyose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni co kizotuma ubgoko bg’ inkomezi bukwubaha, igisagara c’amahanga y’agaterabgoba kizogutinya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.4.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 4:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.32.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "32:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NAM.1.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Nah 1:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuk’ umugorwa wamubereye igihome, wabereye igihome umukene mu vyago vyiwe, ukababera ubgugamo mu gihuhuta, n’igitūtu mu ndugumba, iy’ inkūbi y’abantu b’ agaterabgoba imeze nk’igihuhuta cisuka ku nzu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nk’ukw indugumba yo mu gihugu kigadutse ikūrwaho, ni k’uzozibiza urwamo rw’abanyamahanga; nk’ukw indugumba ikūrwaho n’igitūtu c’igicu, ni k’uzozibiza ivyivugo vy’abantu b’agaterabgoba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
