              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.9.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 9:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko kur’ uwo musi bizovugwa, ngw Eh’ iyi ni yo Mana yacu; ni yo twari turorereye, na yo iradukiza: uyu ni we Uhoraho; ni we twari turorereye; duhimbarwe, tunezererwe agakiza kiwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 25:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOB.40.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yob 40:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.15.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 15:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuk’ ukuboko kw’Uhoraho kuri kur’ uyu musozi, ariko Mowabu hazohonyangirwa ahantu haho, nk’ukw ivyatsi bihonyangirwa mu kiziba c’amaganga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 25:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi hazosānza amaboko hagati muri co, nk’uk’ uwoga asānza amaboko ngo yoge: arikw azotsindagira hasi ubgibone bgaho, bo n’ubugunge bg’amaboko yaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.26.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 26:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ igihome kirekire kigukīngīra c’inzitiro zawe z’amabuye azogisangangura, agitsinde hasi, agishitse mw ivu, mbere no mu mukungugu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.12"
            ]
          }
        }
